# Balthier and Fran: "Whenever a Vehicle crewed by Balthier and Fran this turn attacks" (CR 702.122c). Turn 1 Bot1 casts Balthier and a Passenger Ferry (a 4/3 Vehicle). On turn 3 the Ferry
# is crewed by a Savannah Lions (power 2), not by Balthier and Fran (untapped, in play): the Ferry attacks as a 5/4 (the +1/+1 is Balthier's static for any Vehicle he controls) and
# only its own trigger asks anything, which Bot1 declines; there is no payment to make and no additional combat phase. Bot2 on 15.

